Spoiler Alert includes original Kotlin and Android application code.

The public source distribution intentionally excludes team logos, generated header artwork,
and font files to keep the public tree focused on the application source. The bundled
team and player catalog is a factual, manually curated reference list. Team and league names are
used nominatively for identification. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by any
team, league, player, ESPN, or other rights holder.

The app retrieves public schedule and event-status data from ESPN's public web endpoints only
when a user requests or enables schedule features. ESPN is not affiliated with this project.

